flowchart TD
    Root[高压开关柜维护策略]
    
    S1[事后维修 CM]
    S2[预防性维修 PM]
    S3[状态维修 CBM]
    
    Root --> S1
    Root --> S2
    Root --> S3
    
    S1 --- D1[故障后处理<br>被动响应]
    S2 --- D2[基于时间周期<br>定期检修]
    S3 --- D3[基于设备状态<br>主动预测]
    
    style Root fill:#eee,stroke:#000,stroke-width:2px
    style S1 fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style S2 fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style S3 fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style D1 fill:#fff,stroke:#000,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style D2 fill:#fff,stroke:#000,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style D3 fill:#fff,stroke:#000,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
